        Position: Enough of Scaling LLMs! Lets Focus on Downscaling
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Goel%2C+Y">Yash Goel</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sengupta%2C+A">Ayan Sengupta</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chakraborty%2C+T">Tanmoy Chakraborty</a>
      
