        Attack and defense techniques in large <span class="search-hit mathjax">language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">models</span>: A survey and new perspectives
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liao%2C+Z">Zhiyu Liao</a>, 
      
