    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span>-Driven Dynamic Assessment of Grammatical Accuracy in English Language Learner Writing
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jaganov%2C+T">Timur Jaganov</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Blake%2C+J">John Blake</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Villegas%2C+J">Julián Villegas</a>, 
      
