    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        LLM Ethics Benchmark: A Three-Dimensional Assessment System for Evaluating Moral Reasoning in Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
